{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01042",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 5.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Right, morning, come on through. Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.81,
      "end_seconds": 9.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "oh, only about ten minutes, no trouble"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.75,
      "end_seconds": 16.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.87,
      "end_seconds": 21.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I'm here because of burning when I pass urine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.16,
      "end_seconds": 25.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.63,
      "end_seconds": 30.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Hmm, I've had it for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.39,
      "end_seconds": 36.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Have you had a dull ache low in your tummy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.62,
      "end_seconds": 42.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had that since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.49,
      "end_seconds": 58.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.02,
      "end_seconds": 79.62,
      "duration_seconds": 18.6,
      "text": "I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones. I'm on apixaban, 5 milligrams, twice a day for the heart rhythm. I take telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day. Warfarin I don't take anymore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.86,
      "end_seconds": 87.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "right, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.42,
      "end_seconds": 102.57,
      "duration_seconds": 14.15,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.62,
      "end_seconds": 115.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Right, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.94,
      "end_seconds": 122.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Thin bones, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.24,
      "end_seconds": 124.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.71,
      "end_seconds": 133.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.17,
      "text": "I've got an irregular heartbeat. Ah, I have high blood pressure, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.36,
      "end_seconds": 144.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "Okay, I can see thin bones and an irregular heartbeat in your file as well. Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.49,
      "end_seconds": 155.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "Yes, um, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.86,
      "end_seconds": 173.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any vaginal discharge, blood in the urine, fever or back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.97,
      "end_seconds": 176.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Oh, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.62,
      "end_seconds": 183.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "So, have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.23,
      "end_seconds": 190.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Hmm, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.29,
      "end_seconds": 195.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.02,
      "end_seconds": 208.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.3,
      "end_seconds": 238.92,
      "duration_seconds": 15.62,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, height 165 centimetres. And BMI works out to 34.2, temp 36.5 degrees, weight 93 kilos, BP is 117 over 71, respiratory rate 16, pulse 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.01,
      "end_seconds": 242.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.84,
      "end_seconds": 243.79,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.6,
      "end_seconds": 246.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.16,
      "end_seconds": 264.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with slight tenderness just above the pubic bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.07,
      "end_seconds": 290.27,
      "duration_seconds": 22.2,
      "text": "all finished, thank you. Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards an uncomplicated urinary infection. I think a urine dipstick makes sense here, for burning urine. We'll begin with nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, three days. That should help with urinary infection. Drink plenty of water and avoid holding urine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.55,
      "end_seconds": 301.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.49,
      "text": "Hm, okay. If you get a fever or back pain, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.34,
      "end_seconds": 304.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "okay, makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.95,
      "end_seconds": 313.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "See me again if it is not better in three days. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.1,
      "end_seconds": 315.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "that's clear, thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.85,
      "end_seconds": 318.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
}